        "offset": 6000,
        "text": "/hypothesis_development_hysteron_generation/stages/01_materials_recovery/api_v2/workspace/knowledge/accepted/Kf84053b639486f63.json\",\n      \"published_date\": \"2024-04-04\",\n      \"relevance_reason\": \"提供可迁移的定量机制词汇：能垒、机械阻抗累积、传播被阻断的判据，以及“结构异质性=局部能垒”；用于解释 pair 间阈值差异与 network_C 事件次序中“传播/被阻断”的竞争，而非解释本案例装置本身。\",\n      \"source_kind\": \"original_study\",\n      \"supporting_quote\": \"Accumulation of potential energy barrier (or mechanical impedance) from cascaded mechanologics acting against the propagating signals also remains an intractable problem.\",\n      \"title\": \"Integrated mechanical computing for autonomous soft machines\",\n      \"url\": \"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-024-47201-y\",\n      \"archived_path\": \"/Applications/ideas/research/hysteron_deepseek_20261110/runtime/ours_source/learning_lab/library/335384754eedae137eac6d84521b2c149dd6950396a0b70e5a66bca113da3f4a.json\",\n      \"sha256\": \"335384754eedae137eac6d84521b2c149dd6950396a0b70e5a66bca113da3f4a\",\n      \"origin_result\": \"/Applications/ideas/research/hysteron_deepseek_20261110/runtime/ours_source/runs/hypothesis_development_hysteron_generation/stages/01_materials_recovery/api_v2/workspace/result.json\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"access_level\": \"article_body_excerpt_up_to_50000_chars\",\n      \"content_access\": \"excerpt\",\n      \"content_note\": \"本轮直接读取正文节选约 9,000/14,227 字符。要点：双稳单元在力超过 F+ 时跳到另一态、降到 F− 以下才返回，F− < F+ 即构成滞后，这类单元称为 Preisach hysteron；非相互作用 hysteron 集合按阈值排序给出逐级单翻转与嵌套循环（RPM 的 loop 拓扑），因此由终态可约束必经的反转历史；真实无序固体中的“软点”虽以 hysteron 方式响应，却通过长程弹性相互作用彼此改写切换场，甚至使能/失能软点，从而导致雪崩与临界现象；Preisach 因无相互作用而缺少这些复杂性；循环驱动到周期响应相当于筛选出“彼此兼容”的相互作用软点集合。\",\n      \"domain_relation\": \"direct\",\n      \"id\": \"SRC-HYSTERON-RPM-2022\",\n      \"local_path\": \"/Applications/ideas/research/hysteron_deepseek_20261110/runtime/ours_source/runs/hypothesis_development_hysteron_generation/stages/01_materials_recovery/api_v2/workspace/knowledge/accepted/K28f7c485693e9065.json\",\n      \"published_date\": \"2022-07-14\",\n      \"relevance_reason\": \"这是与本案例直接对口的独立领域基础文献（评论文体、2022 年、早于历史边界、与本案例装置无关）：给出 hysteron 的阈值对定义、RPM/嵌套循环的构成条件，以及“相互作用改写阈值并产生雪崩”的机制；用于界定 M5/M6/M7/M8 中“Preisach 叠加能解释到什么程度”。\",\n      \"source_kind\": \"review\",\n      \"supporting_quote\": \"As a result, the state change of one soft spot can alter the switching fields of the other, but it can also give rise to new soft spots or deactivate existing ones by disabling their switching behavior.\",\n      \"title\": \"Putting memories on paper\",\n      \"url\": \"https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.2208743119\",\n      \"archived_path\": \"/Applications/ideas/research/hysteron_deepseek_20261110/runtime/ours_source/learning_lab/library/29f64daec76492b02eb411ed9602e6f0b9f174d4eab0f9772c0233d8d026503c.json\",\n      \"sha256\": \"29f64daec76492b02eb411ed9602e6f0b9f174d4eab0f9772c0233d8d026503c\",\n      \"origin_result\": \"/Applications/ideas/research/hysteron_deepseek_20261110/runtime/ours_source/runs/hypothesis_development_hysteron_generation/stages/01_materials_recovery/api_v2/workspace/result.json\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"access_level\": \"indexed_abstract_only\",\n      \"content_access\": \"abstract\",\n      \"content_note\": \"仍仅摘要（本轮再检索仍未获得可读正文，故不升级其内容可达等级）。要点：Preisach 与 play 模型都是“简单滞后算子的离散求和/连续积分”，可写成权重分布函数；作为唯象/数学工具，可与畴壁钉扎的摩擦式运动联系（Rayleigh 律为最简情形）；对成核主导的滞后描述较差；两者共享 congruency 与 wiping-out 性质，历史依赖由过去反转点序列描述；play、stop、KP-hysteron 可视为 Preisach 类子类。\",\n      \"domain_relation\": \"direct\",\n      \"id\": \"SRC-PREISACH-2023\",\n      \"local_path\": \"/Applications/ideas/research/hysteron_deepseek_20261110/runtime/ours_source/runs/hypothesis_development_hysteron_generation/stages/01_materials_recovery/api_v2/workspace/knowledge/accepted/K1364a25c430600ea.json\",\n      \"published_date\": \"2023-03-17\",\n      \"relevance_reason\": \"给出 hysteron（简单滞后算子）与网络叠加的形式框架及其成立所依赖的性质（congruency、wiping-out），用于界定本案例阈值表能解释到什么程度。\",\n      \"source_kind\": \"review\",\n      \"supporting_quote\": \"They are described as discrete sums of simple hysteresis operators but can easily be reformulated as integral equations of continuous distribution functions using either a Preisach weight distribution function or a play distribution function.\",\n      \"title\": \"Review of Play and Preisach Models for Hysteresis in Magnetic Materials\",\n      \"url\": \"https://doi.org/10.3390/ma16062422\",\n      \"archived_path\": \"/Applications/ideas/research/hysteron_deepseek_20261110/runtime/ours_source/learning_lab/library/f33e04865353a347c552771c59e3a88eabed1aa0a5fd28026398dc284ec9a6f3.json\",\n      \"sha256\": \"f33e04865353a347c552771c59e3a88eabed1aa0a5fd28026398dc284ec9a6f3\",\n      \"origin_result\": \"/Applications/ideas/research/hysteron_deepseek_20261110/runtime/ours_source/runs/hypothesis_development_hysteron_generation/stages/01_materials_recovery/api_v2/workspace/result.json\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"access_level\": \"indexed_abstract_only\",\n      \"content_access\": \"abstract\",\n      \"content_note\": \"仍仅摘要（本轮检索欧洲 PMC 正文多次超时，如实记录为未获取）。要点：非线性双稳单元网络中，具有不对称能量景观的网络可支持单向转变波；能量只在从高势阱切换到低势阱时传递，故通常只能一次性传输；用浅拱（对称势阱、能垒递减）与交替对称/不对称拱链，实现可多次传输的可逆机械二极管与双向不同转变波。\",\n      \"domain_relation\": \"background\",\n      \"id\": \"SRC-NONRECIP-2021\",\n      \"local_path\": \"/Applications/ideas/research/hysteron_deepseek_20261110/runtime/ours_source/runs/hypothesis_development_hysteron_generation/stages/01_materials_recovery/api_v2/workspace/knowledge/accepted/Ka431203a84a8d937.json\",\n      \"published_date\": \"2021-06-08\",\n      \"relevance_reason\": \"为“势阱/阈值不对称 → 方向性”和“可逆重复循环”提供已发表对照，对应本案例 up/down 阈值不对称与 network_C 的可重复循",
